{
  "title": "The Anglers' Society",
  "subtitle": "Fishing path",
  "icon": "minecraft:fishing_rod",
  "group": "skills",
  "order": 2,
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "sign_up",
      "title": "Entry Form",
      "text": [
        "Commodore Halloway runs the Anglers' Society from Reece. She'll sign you up for the season if you can land five fish with a plain rod."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "talk": "character",
          "character": "halloway",
          "lines": [
            "Another hopeful! Land five fish with a plain rod and you're in.",
            "The season's a long line. Bring patience, and tie good knots."
          ]
        },
        {
          "timed": {
            "seconds": 1200,
            "goal": {
              "stat": "minecraft:fish_caught",
              "count": 5
            },
            "lines": [
              "Five fish before the evening bell, plain rod. Off you go."
            ],
            "start": "Cast off"
          },
          "title": "Land five fish before the evening bell"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:worm",
          "count": 16
        },
        {
          "skill": "fish",
          "xp": 60
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:fishing_rod"
    },
    {
      "id": "bait_and_tackle",
      "title": "Bait and Tackle",
      "after": [
        "sign_up"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Every member keeps a worm farm for bait and a tackle box for hooks and bobbers."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:worm_farm"
        },
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:tackle_box"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:bobber"
        },
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:fishing_line"
        },
        {
          "skill": "fish",
          "xp": 80
        }
      ],
      "icon": "aquaculture:tackle_box"
    },
    {
      "id": "a_rival_appears",
      "title": "A Rival on the Bank",
      "after": [
        "bait_and_tackle"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Someone is coming along the bank, and he looks very pleased with himself."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "encounter": {
            "character": "silas",
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Silas Pike. Champion angler. You've heard of me. Everyone has.",
              "Bet you can't hook Grandfather, the old carp. I just throw him back."
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "fishing"
            ],
            "chance": 0.12,
            "item": {
              "name": "Grandfather, the Old Carp",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/cod",
              "tooltip": "A prize catch"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "skill": "fish",
          "xp": 100
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:cod"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening_cup",
      "title": "The Opening Cup",
      "after": [
        "a_rival_appears"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The first competition of the season, at the nearest fishing hut. The cup goes to whoever lands the society's ribboned trout. The winner wears the lucky angler's hat until next year, or for good, says the Commodore."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#fishing_huts",
          "title": "Go to a fishing hut"
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "fishing"
            ],
            "chance": 0.1,
            "item": {
              "name": "The Ribboned Trout",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/cod",
              "tooltip": "A prize catch"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "artifacts:anglers_hat"
        },
        {
          "skill": "fish",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "artifacts:anglers_hat",
      "signature": "artifacts:anglers_hat"
    },
    {
      "id": "hundred_fish",
      "title": "Tally Book",
      "after": [
        "opening_cup"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The society keeps a lifetime tally for every member. A hundred fish ranks you for the summer heats."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "stats": [
            "minecraft:fish_caught"
          ],
          "count": 100,
          "title": "Bring your lifetime tally to a hundred"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:iron_hook"
        },
        {
          "skill": "fish",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:writable_book"
    },
    {
      "id": "river_heat",
      "title": "The River Heat",
      "after": [
        "opening_cup"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Heat one runs along a river: a brown trout, a smallmouth bass, a bluegill and a perch, and then the heat's marked fish."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:brown_trout"
        },
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:smallmouth_bass"
        },
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:bluegill"
        },
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:perch"
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "fishing"
            ],
            "chance": 0.1,
            "item": {
              "name": "The Heat's Marked Fish",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/cod",
              "tooltip": "A prize catch"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:iron_fishing_rod"
        },
        {
          "skill": "fish",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "aquaculture:brown_trout"
    },
    {
      "id": "hooks_and_lines",
      "title": "Hooked",
      "after": [
        "river_heat"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Silas won the heat on a technicality and won't stop bragging about his hooks. Make your own, so the next heat is fair."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:light_hook"
        },
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:heavy_hook"
        },
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:double_hook"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "aquaculture:gold_hook"
        },
        {
          "skill": "fish",
          "xp": 120
        }
      ],
      "icon": "aquaculture:double_hook"
    },
    {
      "id": "trap_and_net",
      "title": "Traps and Nets",
      "after": [
        "river_heat"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Not every angler sits with a rod. Build a fish trap and a fishing net and set them overnight."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "lilis_lucky_lures:fish_trap"
        },
        {
          "item": "lilis_lucky_lures:fishing_net"
        }
